Home Assistant Better Stack

The error tracking setup and event-processing code is adapted from the
Home Assistant Core Sentry integration, distributed under the Apache License 2.0:
https://github.com/home-assistant/core/tree/2026.10.4/homeassistant/components/sentry

This project modifies that code for Better Stack, including config-entry
lifecycle management, event filtering, privacy controls, and formatted titles.
This is an independent community integration.

The Better Stack logomark is from Simple Icons (CC0-1.0), rendered as PNG in
Better Stack's brand color without changing its proportions:
